OL,3,GNEWSAArson arrest after former care
OL,4,Ahome gutted by fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of arson after a fire
OL,8,Fdestroyed a former care home.
OL,10,FAbout 60 firefighters from 13 fire
OL,11,Fstations were sent to the detached
OL,12,Fproperty between Liss, Hampshire, and
OL,13,FRake, West Sussex, at about 23:15 BST
OL,14,Fon Tuesday.
OL,16,FFire crews spent more than 22 hours on
OL,17,Fthe scene. The B2070 London Road was
OL,18,Fclosed for a lengthy period, police
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,21,FAn 18-year-old man from Portsmouth
OL,22,Fremains in custody, detectives added.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
